<title>CANADA: Reserve Royalty completes private placement.</title>
<headline>Reserve Royalty completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY, Alberta 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reserve Royalty Corp said on Thursday it has completed the private placement of 13,000,750 special warrants previously announced for gross proceeds of C$22.75 million.</p>
<p>The company said it received half of the proceeds on closing with the remainder held until the clearing of the prospectus.</p>
<p>Reserve Royalty officials said they would use the funds from the offering to finance a takeover bid for Stateside Oil Corp.</p>
<p>The company has appointed Montreal Trust Company of Canada as its agent for the special warrants and as depositary for Stateside shares tendered in the takeover bid.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
